/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (Previous research on language planning mostly concentrated on generic tasks, with little attention paid to planning for specific goals with constraints. Requirements relating to what should be done, how it should be done, or why/for whom it is being done are often present in real-world jobs.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
