204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 156 0 R
/E (For abstract goals like "Make a cake," Large Language Models \(LLMs\) can provide efficient step-by-step plans, but they often fail when the goal has specific constraints. For instance, when instructed to "Make a cake for diabetics," InstructGPT produced a recipe that appeared logical but still contained sugar, ignoring the diabetic limitation. This shows that the generated plan may not always be faithful to the user's requirements even if the instructions are clear and coherent. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
