220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 158 0 R
/E (Semantic similarity between each created script and the particular goal is then used to evaluate these candidates. The authors calculate cosine similarity to assess how well each script aligns with the desired goal. Scripts that specifically include the goal limitation are also rewarded. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
