226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 159 0 R
/E (The authors create CoScript, a huge data set created specifically for constrained language planning, using their over-generate-then-filter model. In order to give InstructGPT samples, they start with 14,945 wikiHow article titles as abstract seed goals and obtain 34,260 related wikiHow goals and scripts. Three steps are then taken to create the dataset: )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
